Import "../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua"

Completion and continuing mechanical studies (@mech-completion: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering) { r_6SRKN6GWDTE4453PVA7T2FYGVF
Completing this learning route requires more than opening its Records. Explain machines from ordinary observations through statics, dynamics, material/structural behavior, elements, production, measurement and sustained service. Work through the substantial readings and exercises, all four sets of advanced studies, the integrated machine investigation and an independent research question.

**Demonstrate:** Derive key results without relying on a catalogue answer; independently check the original examples; interpret drawings and measurements; compare architectures and process routes; investigate contradictory evidence; and revise a design or explanation. A physical construction/characterization claim requires physical work. Reading and simulation remain valuable, with their actual scope stated.

Continue into manufacturing engineering, machine tools, precision engineering, tribology, robotics, thermal/fluid machines, structural engineering, controls and materials according to the problem. These linked fields share Records and knowledge; this general mechanical formation does not replace their deeper subjects.

Return through [Engineering](../../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Hephaestus](../../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) and [Ergon](../../../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1) to connect useful machines with the productive systems that supply, operate and maintain them. Follow [Philosophy](../../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001) for questions about explanation, purposes and the judgments underlying engineering choices.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
} r_6SRKN6GWDTE4453PVA7T2FYGVF
